<title>USA: Times Mirror unit extends relationship with AOL.</title>
<headline>Times Mirror unit extends relationship with AOL.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Times Mirror Co's Times Mirror Magazines said Monday it will extend its relationship with America Online Inc to include exclusive, original online programming.</p>
<p>Times Mirror Magazines includes The Sporting News, Golf Magazine, and Popular Science.</p>
<p>The company did not provide financial information on the deal.</p>
